<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2155_8077.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freundtnachbarlich willig dienst
<lb n="2"/>zuvor, Fuersichtige, Eersame und Weise,
<lb n="3"/>besonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> guete Freundt und Nachbarn.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestrigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tags</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Italienischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Spanischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegßvolckß</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>halber, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">furer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abermahlen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertrauwlich</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegeschriben</unclear>, daß haben wir auß er-
<lb n="8"/>meltem ihrem schriben vernomen,
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tundt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> solcher vertrauwlichen
<lb n="10"/>communication <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundtnachbarlich</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bedanckhen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hingegen</unclear> nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bergen</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>daß wir seit unserm jüngsten schreiben
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brichtet</unclear> worden
